    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for letting me know. i was kinda worried about the lights thing but if it's just fatigue then i guess i'm fine for now. i really don't want to go to the doctor/hospital unless it's like an absolute emergency because the waiting rooms are so stressful and expensive. do u think i can just wait a few days and see if the swelling goes down with more water or something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
